flowchart TB
  accTitle: Application composition and service ports
  accDescr: The durable host assembles trusted ports, persistence, decision services and lifecycle services. An operations adapter connects the services to the cognitive graph. Policies remain inside their domain and mechanism owners.
  subgraph HOST[Durable application host]
    PORTS[Trusted host ports and adapters]
    DB[PostgreSQL persistence adapters]
    DEC[Decision services]
    LIFE[Lifecycle services]
    ADAPT[CognitiveCycleServiceOperations]
    APP[CognitiveCycleApplicationGraph]
    PORTS --> DEC
    PORTS --> LIFE
    DB --> DEC
    DB --> LIFE
    DEC --> ADAPT
    LIFE --> ADAPT
    ADAPT --> APP
  end
  GRAPH[LangGraph4j CognitiveCycleGraph]
  APP --> GRAPH
  DOMAIN[Domain rules and simulator authority]
  ACTION[Capability and action boundary]
  DEC <--> DOMAIN
  LIFE --> ACTION
  LIFE <--> DOMAIN
